dazestack-wp (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.1.0 for Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04 LTS.
  * Added native kernel stack, BBRv3, and TCP Fast Open tuning.
  * Added Post-Quantum TLS 1.3 curve (X25519MLKEM768) and 8k SSL buffers.
  * Added MariaDB 11.4 LTS and Redis LTS with high-performance Unix socket.
  * Added PHP 8.4/8.5 OPcache JIT tracing support.

